<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1372032069"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:35.827"><div begin="13.216" end="36.144" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.216" end="24.321" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.216" end="14.142">风吹</span><span begin="14.142" end="14.909">落</span><span begin="14.909" end="15.670">最后</span><span begin="15.670" end="16.404">一</span><span begin="16.404" end="16.874">片</span><span begin="16.874" end="18.077">叶</span> <span begin="19.413" end="20.165">我的</span><span begin="20.165" end="21.049">心</span><span begin="21.049" end="21.321">也</span><span begin="21.321" end="22.553">飘</span><span begin="22.553" end="22.892">着</span><span begin="22.892" end="24.321">雪</span></p><p begin="25.588" end="36.144" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.588" end="26.437">爱只</span><span begin="26.437" end="27.197">能</span><span begin="27.197" end="27.831">往回</span><span begin="27.831" end="29.163">忆里堆</span><span begin="29.163" end="30.298">叠</span> <span begin="30.298" end="31.326">oh</span> <span begin="31.782" end="32.578">给下</span><span begin="32.578" end="33.346">个</span><span begin="33.346" end="33.820">季</span><span begin="33.820" end="36.144">节</span></p></div><div begin="37.911" end="1:01.098" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.911" end="48.150" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.911" end="38.362">忽</span><span begin="38.362" end="38.587">然</span><span begin="38.587" end="39.480">间</span><span begin="39.480" end="40.313">树梢</span><span begin="40.313" end="41.032">冒</span><span begin="41.032" end="41.466">花</span><span begin="41.466" end="42.463">蕊</span> <span begin="42.957" end="43.408">我怎</span><span begin="43.408" end="44.067">么</span><span begin="44.067" end="44.509">会</span><span begin="44.509" end="45.280">都</span><span begin="45.280" end="46.052">没有</span><span begin="46.052" end="46.763">感</span><span begin="46.763" end="48.150">觉</span></p><p begin="48.681" end="1:01.098" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.681" end="49.922">Oh</span> <span begin="50.258" end="50.689">整</span><span begin="50.689" end="50.910">条</span><span begin="50.910" end="51.814">街</span><span begin="51.814" end="52.434">都是</span><span begin="52.434" end="52.645">恋</span><span begin="52.645" end="53.412">爱</span><span begin="53.412" end="53.738">的</span><span begin="53.738" end="54.727">人</span> <span begin="55.189" end="55.610">我独</span><span begin="55.610" end="56.787">自走在</span><span begin="56.787" end="57.555">暖</span><span begin="57.555" end="58.385">风的</span><span begin="58.385" end="1:01.098">夜</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.436" end="1:28.562" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.436" end="1:16.245" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.436" end="1:06.036">多想要向</span><span begin="1:06.036" end="1:06.726">过</span><span begin="1:06.726" end="1:07.606">去告</span><span begin="1:07.606" end="1:09.776">别</span> <span begin="1:10.675" end="1:12.175">当季节不</span><span begin="1:12.175" end="1:13.755">停更</span><span begin="1:13.755" end="1:14.875">迭</span> <span begin="1:14.875" end="1:16.245">Oh</span></p><p begin="1:16.716" end="1:28.562" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.716" end="1:18.401">却还是少</span><span begin="1:18.401" end="1:19.143">一</span><span begin="1:19.143" end="1:19.916">点坚</span><span begin="1:19.916" end="1:22.303">决</span> <span begin="1:22.865" end="1:23.306">在这</span><span begin="1:23.306" end="1:24.439">寂寞的</span><span begin="1:24.439" end="1:26.084">季</span><span begin="1:26.084" end="1:28.562">节</span></p></div><div begin="1:30.243" end="1:53.469" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:30.243" end="1:41.440" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.243" end="1:31.068">艳阳</span><span begin="1:31.068" end="1:31.807">高</span><span begin="1:31.807" end="1:32.632">照在</span><span begin="1:32.632" end="1:33.410">那</span><span begin="1:33.410" end="1:33.817">海</span><span begin="1:33.817" end="1:35.315">边</span> <span begin="1:36.